Package: deskmon
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends:
 nvidia-smi,
Description: Desktop system monitor for deepin (DTK6 native)
 实时显示 CPU/GPU/内存/磁盘/网络 使用情况的桌面悬浮监控小工具，
 原生 DTK6/Qt6 实现，自动跟随系统亮/暗主题。
 Features: floating frameless widget, tray menu, GPU VRAM management,
 process manager, pomodoro timer, sparkline trends and threshold alerts.
